  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0001",
      "text": "AND Logic Error in Mint Cap Check Allows Minting 79 Octillion Tokens in Small Markets",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 85,
      "line": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0002",
      "text": "### Finding description and impact",
      "start": 87,
      "end": 121,
      "line": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0003",
      "text": "The `mintLogic` function contains a critical logic error in the mint cap validation. The code uses `AND (&&)` when it should use `OR (||)`, allowing attackers to mint astronomical amounts of tokens in small markets, leading to complete protocol insolvency.",
      "start": 123,
      "end": 379,
      "line": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0004",
      "text": "**Vulnerable Code:**",
      "start": 381,
      "end": 401,
      "line": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0005",
      "text": "**The Bug:**",
      "start": 403,
      "end": 415,
      "line": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0006",
      "text": "Using `&&` (AND) means BOTH conditions must be true to revert:",
      "start": 417,
      "end": 479,
      "line": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0007",
      "text": "- Condition 1: `mintAmount > Q96` (79,228,162,514,264,337,593,543,950,335)",
      "start": 480,
      "end": 554,
      "line": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0008",
      "text": "- Condition 2: `mintAmount > marketBaseTokenSupply`",
      "start": 555,
      "end": 606,
      "line": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0009",
      "text": "**Attack Scenario:**",
      "start": 608,
      "end": 628,
      "line": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0010",
      "text": "When `mintAmount == Q96` (exactly):",
      "start": 630,
      "end": 665,
      "line": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0011",
      "text": "- Condition 1: `Q96 > Q96` = **FALSE**",
      "start": 666,
      "end": 704,
      "line": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0012",
      "text": "- Condition 2: `Q96 > marketBaseTokenSupply` = TRUE (in small markets)",
      "start": 705,
      "end": 775,
      "line": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0013",
      "text": "- Combined: `FALSE && TRUE` = **FALSE**",
      "start": 776,
      "end": 815,
      "line": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0014",
      "text": "- Result: **No revert** - mint succeeds!",
      "start": 816,
      "end": 856,
      "line": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0015",
      "text": "This allows minting **Q96 = 79,228,162,514,264,337,593,543,950,335 tokens** (79 octillion) even when the market only has 1,000 tokens.",
      "start": 858,
      "end": 992,
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0016",
      "text": "**Economic Impact:**",
      "start": 994,
      "end": 1014,
      "line": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0017",
      "text": "For a market with 1,000 baseToken supply:",
      "start": 1016,
      "end": 1057,
      "line": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0018",
      "text": "- **Normal mint cap:** ~1,000-10,000 tokens (reasonable leverage)",
      "start": 1058,
      "end": 1123,
      "line": 28
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0019",
      "text": "- **Exploit mint amount:** 79,228,162,514,264,337,593,543,950,335 tokens",
      "start": 1124,
      "end": 1196,
      "line": 29
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0020",
      "text": "- **Multiplier:** 79 × 10^30 times market size",
      "start": 1197,
      "end": 1243,
      "line": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0021",
      "text": "- **Result:** Complete protocol insolvency, synthetic tokens unbacked",
      "start": 1244,
      "end": 1313,
      "line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0022",
      "text": "**Mathematical Proof:**",
      "start": 1315,
      "end": 1338,
      "line": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0023",
      "text": "Q96 is defined as:",
      "start": 1340,
      "end": 1358,
      "line": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "e_e17f94097fe4_0024",
      "text": "When attacker mints exactly `Q96` tokens:",
      "start": 1360,
      "end": 1401,
      "line": 37
    }
  ]
}
